EXTRAS=[]
def extra(id,title,hi,rows):EXTRAS.append(dict(id=id,title=title,hi=hi,rows=rows))
extra('reading-guide','How to use this book','इस पुस्तक का उपयोग कैसे करें',[
('Start with the build order','Begin with access and master data, then follow the workflow relevant to your job. Use the screen atlas when you need to identify an exact button.','पहले access और master data पढ़ें। फिर अपने काम का workflow लें। किसी button को पहचानने के लिए screen atlas देखें।'),
('English labels and Hindi explanations','UI labels remain in English so they can be matched to the application. Every procedure includes Hindi instructions beside the English steps.','App से मिलान के लिए UI labels English में हैं। हर procedure में English के साथ Hindi निर्देश हैं।'),
('Prepare then do then verify','Each procedure tells you its purpose, required inputs, numbered steps and the result to check. Complete each check before moving on.','हर procedure में उद्देश्य, तैयारी, numbered steps और result check है। अगला काम शुरू करने से पहले result मिलाएँ।'),
('Screenshots and diagrams','Screenshots show the visible area of the actual application in its narrow responsive window. Open a digital image at native size; scroll within the app to reach lower sections. Diagrams explain connections rather than imitate unavailable screens.','Screenshots वास्तविक app के छोटे responsive window का दिखता भाग हैं। Digital image मूल आकार में खोलें। नीचे के sections के लिए app में scroll करें। Diagrams संबंध समझाते हैं।'),
('Practice safely','Use a designated training environment and example records for exercises. Do not confirm stock, payment, publication or customer-message actions merely to explore the interface.','अभ्यास designated training environment और example records में करें। केवल देखने के लिए stock, payment, publication या customer-message action confirm न करें।'),
('Project snapshot','Prepared 21 October 2026 from the current working tree, including the GST screens present during preparation. Routes and action availability can change with versions, permissions and record state.','21 अक्टूबर 2026 के working tree से तैयार, जिसमें उस समय की GST screens भी हैं। Version, permission और record status के अनुसार routes और actions बदल सकते हैं।'),
('What was verified','Navigation and screenshots were checked read-only. Procedures were traced to UI source, validators and business services. Saves, posting, approvals, provider changes and production deployment were not exercised.','Navigation और screenshots read-only जाँचे गए। Procedures को UI source, validators और business services से मिलाया गया। Save, posting, approval, provider changes और production deployment चलाए नहीं गए।'),
])
extra('first-day','Your first day build order','पहले दिन काम शुरू करने का क्रम',[
('01 Account and rights','Create roles, grant page actions and create users. Verify a permitted page before entering data.','Roles, page actions और users बनाएँ। डेटा भरने से पहले permitted page जाँचें।'),
('02 Reusable masters','Create categories and units, parties and items. Reconcile initial stock and opening party balances.','Categories, units, parties और items बनाएँ। Opening stock और party balances मिलाएँ।'),
('03 Manufacturing','For manufactured items, enable the feature, save the item, add an effective BOM and test a draft production in training.','Manufactured items में feature चालू करें, item save करें, effective BOM जोड़ें और training में draft production देखें।'),
('04 Supply and buying','Create channels, warehouses, SKU mappings and packaging. Import reviewed demand and snapshots; configure material lead times.','Channels, warehouses, SKU mappings और packaging बनाएँ। Reviewed demand और snapshots import करें। Material lead times तय करें।'),
('05 Operations','Record purchase and sales documents. Generate plans, finalize dispatch recommendations and create shipments using the relevant workflow.','Purchase और sales documents भरें। Plans बनाएँ, dispatch recommendations finalize करें और संबंधित workflow से shipments बनाएँ।'),
('06 People and cash','Set up HR masters and employees before attendance and payroll. Configure wallets before income, expense and transfers.','Attendance और payroll से पहले HR masters और employees बनाएँ। Income, expense और transfer से पहले wallets बनाएँ।'),
('07 Daily review','Check source statuses, stock, balances, exceptions and audit history. Export only the report and scope you need.','Source status, stock, balances, exceptions और audit history मिलाएँ। जरूरी report और scope ही export करें।'),
])
extra('example','Worked example from demand to production','मांग से उत्पादन तक पूरा उदाहरण',[
('Training inputs','Illustrative quantities only: finished item FG-CLIP uses 2 units of RM-A and 1 unit of RM-B per unit, with zero wastage for this example. The sales range contains 100 FG-CLIP units over 10 days.','केवल उदाहरण: FG-CLIP की एक unit में RM-A की 2 और RM-B की 1 unit लगती है। इस उदाहरण में wastage zero है। 10 दिन की sales में FG-CLIP की 100 units हैं।'),
('Demand conversion','FG average daily demand is 10. Component average daily usage is RM-A 20 and RM-B 10. The manufacturing BOM owns this conversion.','FG की average daily demand 10 है। Components का daily usage RM-A 20 और RM-B 10 है। यह conversion Manufacturing BOM से आता है।'),
('Lead time and reorder point','RM-A total requirement is 200. With safety factor 0.1 the engine returns safety stock 20. Assume lead time 5 days: lead-time demand is 20 × 5 = 100; reorder point is 100 + 20 = 120.','RM-A की total requirement 200 है। Safety factor 0.1 से safety stock 20 है। Lead time 5 दिन मानें तो lead-time demand 20 × 5 = 100 और reorder point 100 + 20 = 120 है।'),
('Stock and shortage','Assume physical RM-A stock 60 and eligible inbound 10. Projected available is 70, so shortage against 120 is 50. If MOQ and order multiple permit, the suggestion can be 50. The server preview remains authoritative.','मानें physical RM-A stock 60 और योग्य inbound 10 है। Projected available 70 और 120 के मुकाबले shortage 50 है। MOQ और order multiple अनुमति दें तो suggestion 50 हो सकती है। Server preview मान्य है।'),
('Production is a separate action','Producing 20 FG-CLIP units consumes 40 RM-A and 20 RM-B with this zero-wastage recipe. Save the production draft, inspect its snapshot and post only when the actual output is confirmed.','इस zero-wastage recipe में 20 FG-CLIP बनाने पर RM-A 40 और RM-B 20 लगते हैं। Production draft save करें, snapshot देखें और actual output सही होने पर post करें।'),
('Complete the handoff','A saved procurement plan does not place an order. A finalized dispatch plan does not ship goods. Complete the purchase, production and shipment workflows separately and verify each resulting document.','Saved procurement plan अपने आप order नहीं देता। Finalized dispatch plan अपने आप माल नहीं भेजता। Purchase, production और shipment workflows अलग पूरे करें और हर document जाँचें।'),
])
extra('daily-close','Daily and monthly operating checks','रोज और महीने के अंत की जाँच',[
('Sales desk','Check draft versus confirmed invoices, receipts received, due balances and cancelled documents. Match the date range before comparing reports.','Draft और confirmed invoices, received payments, due balances और cancelled documents देखें। Reports मिलाते समय date range एक रखें।'),
('Purchase desk','Check orders awaiting conversion, duplicate supplier invoice numbers, unpaid bills, returns and expense categories.','Conversion बाकी orders, duplicate supplier invoice numbers, unpaid bills, returns और expense categories देखें।'),
('Production and inventory','Review posted and cancelled production, missing active BOMs, low or negative stock and unexplained item-ledger movements.','Posted और cancelled production, missing active BOM, low या negative stock और unexplained item-ledger movements देखें।'),
('Planning and logistics','Review stale snapshots, unmapped SKUs, warnings, draft plans, allocation shortfalls, incomplete packing, failed attempts, returns and unpaid freight.','पुराने snapshots, unmapped SKU, warnings, draft plans, allocation shortfalls, incomplete packing, failed attempts, returns और unpaid freight देखें।'),
('HR','Resolve not-marked attendance, pending adjustments and leave before reviewing payroll. Compare gross, deductions and net with the intended period.','Payroll से पहले not-marked attendance, pending adjustments और leave resolve करें। Gross, deductions और net को सही period से मिलाएँ।'),
('Cash and governance','Reconcile wallet ledgers and transfers. Review source-linked freight postings, activity history, website publication state and unresolved warranty claims.','Wallet ledgers और transfers मिलाएँ। Freight postings, activity history, website publication state और unresolved warranty claims देखें।'),
])
extra('troubleshooting','Troubleshooting decision guide','समस्या आने पर निर्णय गाइड',[
('Nothing is listed','Clear search, status and date filters; check the correct module and page number. A blank period is not proof that the whole database is empty.','Search, status और date filters हटाएँ। सही module और page देखें। खाली period का अर्थ पूरा database खाली नहीं।'),
('Cannot find an item or party','Check active status, item type or material classification and picker filters. Ensure required category, unit, channel and mapping masters exist.','Active status, item type या classification और picker filters देखें। जरूरी category, unit, channel और mapping हो।'),
('Button missing or disabled','Check View versus action permissions, record status, required data and current loading state. A finalized plan or read-only imported row may deliberately block editing.','View और action permissions, record status, required data तथा loading देखें। Finalized plan या imported row में editing बंद हो सकती है।'),
('Validation or date error','Read the exact field message. Use valid calendar dates, nonnegative quantities where specified and a correct start-to-end order. Keep dimensions and weights in matching units.','Field का exact error पढ़ें। Valid dates, निर्धारित nonnegative quantities और सही date order दें। Dimensions और weights की units मिलाएँ।'),
('Concurrent edit or conflict','Reload the latest record, compare changes and apply only the intended revision. For planning, refresh changed prerequisites and validate again.','Latest record reload करके changes मिलाएँ और सही revision करें। Planning prerequisites बदलें तो refresh और validate करें।'),
('Timeout after an action','Inspect the source record or batch status before retrying. This matters for posting production, dispatching stock, payments and GST provider changes.','Retry से पहले source record या batch status देखें। Production posting, dispatch, payments और GST provider actions में यह जरूरी है।'),
('Cannot export','Check Export permission, report filters, selected item requirements, loaded rows and any displayed export error. Some module export buttons may be unavailable in the current state.','Export permission, report filters, required item, loaded rows और error देखें। कुछ export buttons current state में unavailable हो सकते हैं।'),
])
extra('developer-architecture','Project architecture and source map','प्रोजेक्ट आर्किटेक्चर और सोर्स मैप',[
('Frontend','frontend contains React 19, Vite 8, Redux Toolkit, React Router, Tailwind, React Hook Form and Zod. AppRoutes registers screens; sidebar configuration and permission-aware hooks control navigation.','frontend में React 19, Vite 8, Redux Toolkit, React Router, Tailwind, React Hook Form और Zod हैं। AppRoutes screens और sidebar तथा permission hooks navigation सँभालते हैं।'),
('Request path','The browser calls service modules through the shared Axios client and runtime API origin. Authentication adds the access token and refresh handling. Endpoint paths already include /api.','Browser service modules से shared Axios client और runtime API origin पर calls करता है। Authentication access token और refresh सँभालता है। Endpoint paths में /api पहले से है।'),
('API and application','backend/src/Cosmos.API hosts ASP.NET Core .NET 10 controllers, middleware and permission filters. Cosmos.Application coordinates validation, business rules, calculations and audit calls.','Cosmos.API में ASP.NET Core .NET 10 controllers, middleware और permission filters हैं। Cosmos.Application validation, business rules, calculation और audit calls सँभालता है।'),
('Data and integrations','Cosmos.Persistence uses Dapper and SQL Server stored procedures. Domain holds types and permission names; Contracts holds DTOs; Infrastructure provides JWT, BCrypt, GSTZen and website file storage.','Cosmos.Persistence में Dapper और SQL Server stored procedures हैं। Domain में types और permissions, Contracts में DTOs तथा Infrastructure में JWT, BCrypt, GSTZen और file storage हैं।'),
('Database and tests','backend/database contains baseline SQL, GST integration, module migrations and verification scripts. backend/tests/Cosmos.Tests contains backend tests; frontend tests sit beside source files.','backend/database में baseline SQL, GST integration, migrations और verification scripts हैं। Backend tests Cosmos.Tests में और frontend tests source के साथ हैं।'),
('Configuration and evidence','Read current source before older audit notes. The book source index records paths and hashes for reproducibility. This handbook includes uncommitted screens visible in the working tree at preparation time.','पुरानी audit notes से पहले current source देखें। Source index में reproducibility के लिए paths और hashes हैं। इस book में preparation के समय working tree में मौजूद uncommitted screens भी हैं।'),
])
extra('developer-setup','Build and start a local environment','लोकल एनवायरनमेंट बिल्ड और शुरू करें',[
('01 Prerequisites','Install the project-compatible Node runtime, .NET 10 SDK and SQL Server access. Use the versions and package locks in this checkout. Keep a separate development database.','Project-compatible Node runtime, .NET 10 SDK और SQL Server access रखें। Checkout के versions और package locks लें। अलग development database रखें।'),
('02 Database','Review backend/database/001_Full_Database_Setup.sql and 003_gst_integration_module.sql, then the ordered module migrations and their prerequisites. Apply to the intended database through a controlled deployment process; smoke-test scripts may write data.','Baseline और GST SQL scripts पढ़ें। फिर ordered migrations और prerequisites जाँचें। Controlled deployment से सही database पर लागू करें। Smoke-test scripts data लिख सकती हैं।'),
('03 API configuration','Configure ConnectionStrings__CosmosDb, Jwt__Issuer, Jwt__Audience, Jwt__SigningKey and the COSMOS_SYSTEM_OWNER_USERNAME, COSMOS_SYSTEM_OWNER_EMAIL and COSMOS_SYSTEM_OWNER_PASSWORD variables. Use your own secrets.','ConnectionStrings__CosmosDb, Jwt__Issuer, Jwt__Audience, Jwt__SigningKey और COSMOS_SYSTEM_OWNER_USERNAME, EMAIL तथा PASSWORD variables सेट करें। अपने secrets लें।'),
('04 Start the API','From the repository root run dotnet restore backend/Cosmos.slnx, dotnet build backend/Cosmos.slnx and dotnet run --project backend/src/Cosmos.API --launch-profile http. The checked-in HTTP profile uses port 5278.','Root से dotnet restore, dotnet build और API का dotnet run command चलाएँ। Checked-in HTTP profile port 5278 लेता है। नीचे exact commands हैं।'),
('05 Start the frontend','In frontend run npm ci. Set VITE_API_BASE_URL to the chosen API origin, then run npm run dev. Local Vite normally serves port 5173; use the URL printed by the server.','frontend में npm ci चलाएँ। VITE_API_BASE_URL को चुने API origin पर सेट करें और npm run dev लें। Vite सामान्यतः 5173 लेता है; server का printed URL मानें।'),
('06 Verify','Open /health and the API Swagger UI, then sign in through the frontend. Verify required modules and permissions against the intended database. A health response alone does not prove every database module is ready.','/health और API Swagger खोलें, फिर frontend से sign in करें। सही database पर modules और permissions जाँचें। Health response से हर DB module तैयार होना साबित नहीं होता।'),
])
extra('deployment','Build deployment and maintenance checklist','बिल्ड डिप्लॉयमेंट और रखरखाव',[
('Frontend build','Use npm run build in frontend. The deployed frontend requires API_BASE_URL at runtime or VITE_API_BASE_URL at build time. Use an HTTP(S) API origin; endpoint paths already include /api.','frontend में npm run build चलाएँ। Deployed frontend में runtime API_BASE_URL या build-time VITE_API_BASE_URL चाहिए। HTTP(S) API origin दें; endpoint paths में /api पहले से है।'),
('Runtime origin','The runtime configuration accepts an API origin or the same-origin /api form. Production rejects missing API configuration. Do not concatenate another /api onto every endpoint.','Runtime config API origin या same-origin /api स्वीकार करती है। Production में missing API config reject होती है। हर endpoint पर extra /api न जोड़ें।'),
('Containers','docker-compose.yml exposes the API on 8080 and frontend on 3000. Set COSMOS_API_BASE_URL to an address reachable from the browser. Compose does not provision SQL Server.','docker-compose.yml API को 8080 और frontend को 3000 पर expose करती है। COSMOS_API_BASE_URL browser से पहुँचने वाला दें। Compose SQL Server नहीं बनाती।'),
('Database ownership','Track which migrations are applied, verify stored-procedure contracts and preserve migration dependencies. The repository has verification and smoke scripts, but not a universal automatic migration runner.','Applied migrations लिखें, stored-procedure contracts और dependencies जाँचें। Repo में verification और smoke scripts हैं; universal automatic migration runner नहीं।'),
('Validation commands','Run frontend npm test, npm run lint and npm run build for relevant changes. Run dotnet test backend/Cosmos.slnx for backend changes. These are maintenance commands, not a claim they were run while writing this book.','Relevant change पर frontend npm test, npm run lint और npm run build लें। Backend पर dotnet test backend/Cosmos.slnx लें। Book बनाते समय इन्हें चलाने का दावा नहीं है।'),
('Backups and operations','Back up SQL Server and stored upload files under the organization process. Restore-test both. Preserve logs and correlation IDs for incidents, and restrict provider secrets to server configuration.','Organization process से SQL Server और uploads का backup लें तथा restore test करें। Incidents में logs और correlation IDs रखें। Provider secrets server config में रखें।'),
])
extra('limitations','Current capability and evidence notes','मौजूदा सुविधा और प्रमाण की सीमाएँ',[
('Actual captures','The screen atlas contains live read-only captures. Many lists have no matching data. It does not fabricate posted transactions or successful approvals to fill the screenshots.','Screen atlas में live read-only captures हैं। कई lists में matching data नहीं है। Screenshots भरने के लिए नकली posted transactions या approvals नहीं बनाए गए।'),
('Record-dependent workspaces','Invoice details, manufacturing forms, saved run details, shipment tabs and warranty details require real record IDs. Their procedures are explained from current source; screenshots of those states are included only when accessible without creating business data.','Invoice details, manufacturing forms, saved run, shipment tabs और warranty details के लिए real record IDs चाहिए। इनके procedures current source से समझाए गए; business data बनाए बिना मिले states के ही screenshots हैं।'),
('Planning boundaries','Global item stock is different from marketplace warehouse snapshots. A plan, allocation, draft shipment and actual dispatch have distinct effects. Refer to the source status after any uncertain action.','Global item stock और marketplace warehouse snapshots अलग हैं। Plan, allocation, draft shipment और dispatch के effects अलग हैं। Uncertain action के बाद source status जाँचें।'),
('GST dependencies','Existing document lookup and supported guarded changes are present. Generation, extension, OTP and effective-date HSN or rate modules have backend dependencies. Missing APIs are not working features.','Existing document lookup और guarded changes मौजूद हैं। Generation, extension, OTP और effective-date HSN या rate modules backend पर निर्भर हैं। Missing APIs को working feature न समझें।'),
('Website boundary','The management screens are documented. Public availability and provider outcomes were not certified. Publication and customer-message actions can have external effects.','Management screens documented हैं। Public availability और provider outcomes certify नहीं किए गए। Publication और customer-message के external effects हो सकते हैं।'),
('Training completion','The daily checklist and exercises are instructions for the reader. Book preparation did not create users, change permissions, post stock, send messages or publish website changes.','Daily checklist और exercises पाठक के लिए हैं। Book बनाते समय users, permissions, stock posting, messages या website publication नहीं बदले गए।'),
])
